[en.FOCUS_C08_CITY_SUMMIT]
Eastern Equestria Cities’ Summit

[en.FOCUS_C08_CITY_SUMMIT_desc]
The ponies of Eastern Equestria are united, and the melody of unity echoes throughout Eastern Equestria.\n\nLet the ponies under the rule of the illegal empire be aware that the illegal empire is already divided and struggling, while the Liberation Front is united and determined to make Cozy Glow pay her price!

[zh.FOCUS_C08_CITY_SUMMIT]
东小马利亚城市代表大会

[zh.FOCUS_C08_CITY_SUMMIT_desc]
东小马利亚的小马们团结一致，联合的旋律响彻东小马利亚。\n\n让伪帝国统治下的小马们知道，伪帝国已经四分五裂，而解放阵线团结一心，势必让和煦光流受到应有的惩罚！

